 |" :question/worked-solution "We subtract the corresponding entries:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}P-Q & =\\begin{bmatrix}-6 & 4 & 9 \\\\ 7 & -2 & 5 \\\\ 10 & 0 & -3\\end{bmatrix}-\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -8 & 6 \\\\ -4 & 3 & -7 \\\\ 12 & -5 & 9\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-6-1 & 4-(-8) & 9-6 \\\\ 7-(-4) & -2-3 & 5-(-7) \\\\ 10-12 & 0-(-5) & -3-9\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-7 & \\,\\,12 & 3 \\\\ \\,\\,\\,11 & -5 & 12 \\\\ -2 & 5 & -12\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186335984 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "25c0580a-41f6-5d9a-9c8d-d1cec501b9a0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -7 & -9 \\\\ -1 & 14 & -13\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186333338} {:answer/id #uuid "3926fda8-51f5-51cf-826d-d80611e5ff61" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & -2 & -5 \\\\ 6 & -9 & 11\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186333523} {:answer/id #uuid "75c4ccde-f29b-5f98-8e5a-095cb79e5d96" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}6 & -9 & 11 \\\\ -1 & -2 & -5\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186334053} {:answer/id #uuid "e6714eab-8883-5152-91ba-d87d8c346827" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}6 & 7 & 11 \\\\ -1 & 14 & -4\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186335001} {:answer/id #uuid "f8699957-4b4d-5838-87d2-12a52e72da4e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}6 & 11 & -9 \\\\ -1 & -5 & -2\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186335164}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "75c4ccde-f29b-5f98-8e5a-095cb79e5d96" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}6 & -9 & 11 \\\\ -1 & -2 & -5\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186334053} :answer-field/id #uuid "7105b117-fd04-5afa-82c0-7e01aaab6677" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186335458}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "bb969907-0d5e-590c-8aaa-5a753b6853bf" :question/math-academy-id "q-69603" :question/problem "$\\begin{bmatrix}4 & -8 & 1 \\\\ -2 & 6 & -9\\end{bmatrix}-\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 1 & -10 \\\\ -1 & 8 & -4\\end{bmatrix}=$" :question/worked-solution "We subtract the corresponding entries:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{bmatrix}4 & -8 & 1 \\\\ -2 & 6 & -9\\end{bmatrix}-\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 1 & -10 \\\\ -1 & 8 & -4\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}4-(-2) & -8-1 & 1-(-10) \\\\ -2-(-1) & 6-8 & -9-(-4)\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}6 & -9 & 11 \\\\ -1 & -2 & -5\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] :knowledge-point/title "Subtracting Matrices"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186087697 :knowledge-point/canonical-example {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186087504 :question/id #uuid "79974103-2da9-599a-b33b-abac3d32613a" :question/math-academy-id "e-4392" :question/problem "Which of the following are diagonal matrices?\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 3\\end{bmatrix}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "- $Q$ is a diagonal matrix. It's a square matrix since it has the same number of rows and columns. Also, all the entries that do not lie on the main diagonal are zeros.\n\nNotice that $Q$ is not an identity matrix since the diagonal entries are not all ones.\n\n- $R$ is *not* a diagonal matrix. It's a square matrix since it has the same number of rows and columns. But some of the entries that do not lie on the main diagonal are not zeros (for instance, $r_{13}=1 \\neq 0$).\n\n- $S$ is a diagonal matrix. It's a square matrix since it has the same number of rows and columns. Also, all the entries that do not lie on the main diagonal are zeros.\n\nNotice that $S$ is not an identity matrix since the diagonal entries are not all ones.\n\nTherefore, only $Q$ and $S$ are diagonal matrices."} :knowledge-point/id #uuid "09fa0899-a3d2-584f-8cdd-a471f8cfd16b" :knowledge-point/questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 1759218