 $Q$ is *not* a diagonal matrix since it's not a square matrix.\n\n- $R$ is *not* a diagonal matrix. It's a square matrix since it has the same number of rows and columns. But some of the entries that do not lie on the main diagonal are not zeros (for instance, ${r}_{31}=7\\ne 0$).\n\nTherefore, none of the given are diagonal matrices."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186403300 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "24e354b0-5651-5594-b600-5157d60ee1a0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186473230} {:answer/id #uuid "28c40711-ea8e-5ff4-b320-4746003a1ba1" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186473231}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "24e354b0-5651-5594-b600-5157d60ee1a0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186473230} :answer-field/id #uuid "44b3ac7f-42db-5817-b940-ff79699394b7" :answer-field/key "R" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474010} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "96c0f227-2afe-559c-bbe1-30de827c55b8" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186473232} {:answer/id #uuid "52e73633-ed6b-54dd-9785-0ed9d66e64aa" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186473233}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "52e73633-ed6b-54dd-9785-0ed9d66e64aa" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186473233} :answer-field/id #uuid "35b1dcd6-aff8-5097-8c1c-012edb68e27c" :answer-field/key "S" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474011} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "6b2ea28d-150d-554d-864f-0de6f3ae280f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186473234} {:answer/id #uuid "ba048084-4a5b-5ba4-a6f7-256f4eaa2a0e" :an